# Test filter for interactive_ui_tests on mac26-arm64-rel (MacOS 26 ARM64)

# TODO(b/580867054): On Mac-26 VMs (VirtualMac2,1), the virtual display's usable
# work area height clamps BrowserWidget to ~681px, causing vertical (kStacked)
# split-view resize tests that assume >=686px / 1000px window height to fail.
-SplitTabLayout/MultiContentsViewUiTest.ResizesInSplitView/1
-SplitTabLayout/MultiContentsViewUiTest.ResizesToMinSize/1
